WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.350
Open the hub. Choose Screenshot.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.480
Drag over the area you want to capture.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.670
Check the crop and confirm it.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.690
Add a request next to the screenshot.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.670
Send. The request is pending in History.
